{
 "duration": 24.057,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mark felt a hot spot on his heel two miles in.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.958
  },
  {
   "text": "He told himself he'd deal with it at the top.",
   "start": 3.158,
   "end": 5.143
  },
  {
   "text": "By the summit it was a full blister, and every step down hurt.",
   "start": 5.393,
   "end": 8.834
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 9.184,
   "end": 10.111
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop the moment you feel rubbing.",
   "start": 10.411,
   "end": 12.006
  },
  {
   "text": "Take off the boot, dry the skin and cover the spot with tape or a bandage before it breaks.",
   "start": 12.206,
   "end": 17.683
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Mark carries a small first-aid kit and stops early.",
   "start": 18.083,
   "end": 21.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next long hike.",
   "start": 21.902,
   "end": 23.857
  }
 ],
